@startuml Observer Pattern

title 观察者模式 (Observer Pattern)
caption 设计模式：观察者模式 - 敌机响应道具效果

interface EnemyObserver <<interface>> {
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

abstract class PropSubject {
    -observers: List<EnemyObserver>
    +addObserver(EnemyObserver)
    +removeObserver(EnemyObserver)
    +notifyBomb()*
    +notifyFreeze()*
}

class Prop {
    +notifyBomb()
    +notifyFreeze()
    +triggerBomb()
    +triggerFreeze()
}

abstract class AbstractAircraft {
    <<implements>> EnemyObserver
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

class MobEnemy {
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

class EliteEnemy {
    -isFrozen: boolean
    -freezeStartTime: long
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

class ElitePlusEnemy {
    -isFrozen: boolean
    -freezeStartTime: long
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

class UltimateEnemy {
    -isSlowed: boolean
    -slowStartTime: long
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

class BossEnemy {
    +onBomb()
    +onFreeze()
}

PropSubject <|-- Prop : extends
EnemyObserver <|.. AbstractAircraft : implements
AbstractAircraft <|-- MobEnemy : extends
AbstractAircraft <|-- EliteEnemy : extends
AbstractAircraft <|-- ElitePlusEnemy : extends
AbstractAircraft <|-- UltimateEnemy : extends
AbstractAircraft <|-- BossEnemy : extends
Prop "1" --> "*" EnemyObserver : manages

note left of EnemyObserver
  角色：抽象观察者 (Observer)
  定义响应接口
end note

note right of PropSubject
  角色：抽象被观察者 (Subject)
  管理观察者列表
end note

note bottom of Prop
  角色：具体被观察者 (ConcreteSubject)
  实现通知逻辑
end note

note bottom of MobEnemy
  角色：具体观察者 (ConcreteObserver)
  炸弹：坠毁，冰冻：永久静止
end note

@enduml